---
title: "member_lookup_by_discord_uid (debug.sql: Debug SQL Query Collection)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_input: discord_uid = input_value
    q_input --> q_query: SELECT FROM member.members WHERE discord_uid = input_value
    q_query --> q_found: row exists
    q_query --> q_not_found: row does not exist
    q_found --> [*]: return (supabase_auth_user_id, discord_uid, generation, status, student_number, is_admin)
    q_not_found --> [*]: return empty result set

    note right of q_query
        INV-001: discord_uid is a unique identifier per member
        INV-002: supabase_auth_user_id is the primary key of members table
        INV-003: Input discord_uid must not be NULL or empty string
    end note
